<LegalLayout title="Terms" heading="The fine print, kept short." lastUpdated="May 2026">
  <p>
    These are the terms for <strong>westondeanmusic.com</strong>. The site is a marketing page for a solo acoustic musician (me, Weston Dean) based in Mobile, Alabama. Read on for what you can expect and what you're agreeing to by using it.
